   "subject": "Empty plot",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi ggvis team,<div><br></div><div>I started to explore what ggvis can do in a non-trivial app using hfligths data as example. I summarized the data by flight number and could plot distance by delay. So far so good, but when I put the month as additional variable into the mix  it only works as local ggvis command. </div><div><br></div><div><div>DelayByFlightNum %&gt;%</div><div>    ggvis(~dist, ~delay) %&gt;%</div><div>    layer_points(fill =~ Month)</div></div><div><br></div><div>Included in a simple shiny app I get an empty plot:</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;font-size:14px;line-height:15px;white-space:pre-wrap;border-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(225,226,229)\"><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Droid Sans Mono&#39;;outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span><font color=\"#073763\">shiny::runGitHub(&quot;ggvis-hflights&quot;, &quot;thomassiegmund&quot;)</font></span></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Droid Sans Mono&#39;;outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:rgb(127,0,85)\"><br></span></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">Best</font></span></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><br></font></span></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">Thomas</font></span></pre></span></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
