     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Ah, I think you&#39;re running into this bug with grouped data in dynamic plots:<div><div><a href=\"https://github.com/rstudio/ggvis/issues/71\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/rstudio/ggvis/issues/71&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485050621000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2_yr3ylPS8dFXsSOaYC4FR\">https://github.com/rstudio/ggvis/issues/71</a><br></div><div><br>\r\n\r\n</div><div>You can work around it for now by ungrouping your data:</div><div>DelayByFlightNum &lt;- DelayByFlightNum %&gt;% ungroup()</div></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Hopefully we&#39;ll have a fix in the next few days.</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br></div><div>-Winston</div><div><br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Tue, May 27, 2014 at 12:26 PM, Thomas Siegmund <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">thomas....@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br>\r\n\r\n<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><br></div><div>&gt; Can you include code for a reproducible example?<br></div><div><br>\r\n\r\n</div></div><div>Sure.</div><div><br></div><a href=\"https://github.com/ThomasSiegmund/ggvis-hflights\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/ThomasSiegmund/ggvis-hflights&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485050621000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1YCh_8b5mReUiUmQlxjGla\">https://github.com/ThomasSiegmund/ggvis-hflights</a><div><br></div><div><div><pre style=\"border-style:none;font-family:&#39;Droid Sans Mono&#39;;outline:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\">\r\n\r\n<font color=\"#073763\">shiny::runGitHub(&quot;ggvis-<u></u>hflights&quot;, &quot;thomassiegmund&quot;)</font></pre><pre style=\"border-style:none;font-family:&#39;Droid Sans Mono&#39;;outline:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\">\r\n\r\n<font color=\"#073763\"><br></font></pre></div><pre style=\"border-style:none;font-family:&#39;Droid Sans Mono&#39;;outline:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\">\r\n\r\n<font color=\"#073763\">Thanks</font></pre><pre style=\"border-style:none;font-family:&#39;Droid Sans Mono&#39;;outline:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><font color=\"#073763\"><br>\r\n\r\n</font></pre><pre style=\"border-style:none;font-family:&#39;Droid Sans Mono&#39;;outline:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><font color=\"#073763\">Thomas</font></pre>\r\n\r\n<div><br>On Tuesday, May 27, 2014 6:25:47 PM UTC+2, Winston wrote:</div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\r\nCan you include code for a reproducible example?</div></div><div><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div>On Mon, May 26, 2014 at 3:29 PM, Thomas Siegmund <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">thomas....@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi ggvis team,<div><br></div><div>I started to explore what ggvis can do in a non-trivial app using hfligths data as example. I summarized the data by flight number and could plot distance by delay. So far so good, but when I put the month as additional variable into the mix  it only works as local ggvis command. </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div><br></div><div><div>DelayByFlightNum %&gt;%</div><div>    ggvis(~dist, ~delay) %&gt;%</div><div>    layer_points(fill =~ Month)</div></div><div><br></div><div>Included in a simple shiny app I get an empty plot:</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div><br></div><div><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;font-size:14px;line-height:15px;white-space:pre-wrap;border-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(225,226,229)\"><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Droid Sans Mono&#39;;outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\">\r\n\r\n<span><font color=\"#073763\">shiny::runGitHub(&quot;ggvis-<u></u>hflights&quot;, &quot;thomassiegmund&quot;)</font></span></pre><pre style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Droid Sans Mono&#39;;outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\">\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(127,0,85)\"><br></span></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">Best</font></span></pre>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span><font color=\"#888888\"><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><br>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</font></span></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">Thomas</font></span></pre>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</font></span></span></div></div></div><span><font color=\"#888888\"><div>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;ggvis&quot; group.<br></div>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a rel=\"nofollow\">ggvis+un...@<u></u>googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo post to this group, send email to <a rel=\"nofollow\">gg...@googlegroups.com</a>.<div><br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485050621000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Kp7ew_kibNMNHPSu-NIe4\">https://groups.google.com/d/<u></u>optout</a>.<br>\r\n</div></font></span></blockquote></div><br></div>\r\n</blockquote></div></div><div><div>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;ggvis&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggvis+un...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo post to this group, send email to